    "type": "game",
    "name": "Electronic Market Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3041550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; is a cool-headed first-person simulation with every detail of running an Electronic Market.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store to be beautiful and efficient. Determine where products will be displayed, manage your shelves and provide a perfect shopping experience by increasing customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPLY GOODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order items using the in-game computer. Place the products in your store as you wish and offer them to your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASHIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move items through registers and collect payments by cash or credit card. Hire extra cashiers to increase customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SET PRICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, level up and expand your store. Then increase your earnings by renting new stores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer satisfaction and price policy are very important to be successful in the &quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; game. Will you be able to win this race to get to the top of the city by making the right decisions and increasing the number of stores?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; is a cool-headed first-person simulation with every detail of running an Electronic Market.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/1e5900c66f0c3111327dcb949a02f08f.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store to be beautiful and efficient. Determine where products will be displayed, manage your shelves and provide a perfect shopping experience by increasing customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPLY GOODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order items using the in-game computer. Place the products in your store as you wish and offer them to your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASHIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move items through registers and collect payments by cash or credit card. Hire extra cashiers to increase customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SET PRICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.poster.avif?t=1751737364\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.webm?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.mp4?t=1751737364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, level up and expand your store. Then increase your earnings by renting new stores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer satisfaction and price policy are very important to be successful in the &quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; game. Will you be able to win this race to get to the top of the city by making the right decisions and increasing the number of stores?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Electronic Market Simulator is a detailed simulation game where players manage and operate their own electronics store. Players sell products, boost customer satisfaction, and aim to become the top store. Strategic decisions in store management, customer service, and finances are required.",
